aduate, the members of Karasuno's volleyball team must learn to settle their differences and train harder than ever if they hope to overcome formidable opponents old and new—including their archrival Aoba Jousai and its world-class setter Tooru Oikawa.\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"},"tags":[{"name":"Volleyball","rank":98,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School Club","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Ensemble Cast","rank":86,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":85,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Male Cast","rank":82,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Shounen","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":78,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":62,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tomboy","rank":10,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"HAIKYU!! 2nd Season","english":"HAIKYU!! 2nd Season","native":"ハイキュー!! セカンドシーズン","romaji":"Haikyuu!! 2nd Season","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"排球少年 第二季"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"Haikyuu!! Second Season"}]},"trailer":{"id":"qK_ASmBoiz0","site":"youtube","thumbnail":"https://i.ytimg.com/vi/qK_ASmBoiz0/hqdefault.jpg"},"visibility":"general"}